76c3aba020b8fe8f93a2aa 3x"}, "body": "Hello Mr. Sanroku Fugu Sensei.\nI love the sparkling and attractive personification of F1 cars that you draw.\nI have requested this because I wanted to see a child again, which I have less chance to see since the season has changed.\n\n[Details of request\nThe character is W12 car 77 and the clothes can be either the last race or normal.\n\nI would like to see her in any pose, facial expression, situation, composition, etc. I would like her to be drawn as she pleases. I would like you to draw the character as you like.\n\nUsage.\nFor personal use only.\n\nThank you for always showing us your wonderful illustrations. I will continue to support you.\nYou can kick this request if it is annoying \ud83d\ude47.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@743Jpuru/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1229256, "client_id": 634882, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=423511f9dbac1ef67cce8c567168e9e0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=423511f9dbac1ef67cce8c567168e9e0, https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=069c9da1b6d82e45460936d861561981 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96899bfaa63aed1c156e9ec0d20bb597 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54fb056d95d6fde11741d06f6b11252d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54fb056d95d6fde11741d06f6b11252d, https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4be9e3ea57f3aa19e65468576490d466 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08c49689/uploads/origins/d8d2cb15-e925-4df3-9258-e3f80758433f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1dc9ab1eb0562741da20f3b861e99c6c 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your help.\nWe would like you to draw our child, a Kihani 5000 anthropomorphic character.\n\nThe reference for the appearance is as shown in the URL, but I don't have a very detailed setting because I have not drawn much myself recently.\n\nI think it is difficult to understand from the reference material, so I would like to add that the clothes have the texture of work clothes, and the color in the setting is brown (so-called grape color No. 1), which is very close to black. The shirt is drawn with a design similar to that of the boarding doors of the actual car, but I don't know if it is uneven or printed. ......\nThe hair color is grayish rather than silver.\nI would appreciate it if you could make up or cover up the details as you see fit!\n\nThe drawing of her body is not stable enough, so it is hard to tell, but please give her a childish look. (It would be better if it has the atmosphere that Mr. Sanroku usually draws.)\n\nI would like her to have a childlike personality, but she may smile, so any kind of facial expression is fine.\n\nI can leave the pose and composition up to you!\u3000I would like to see the atmosphere you draw!\u3000If it is OK with you, I would be grateful